@AERIS_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271

### 1. Obținere evaluare scenariu demonstrativ (GET)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/planning/sample
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Evaluare scenariu custom prin POST (toată matematica evaluată)
POST {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/planning/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rules": {
    "minimumGapSeconds": 120,
    "allowVfr": true,
    "baseTimeOffsetSeconds": 50400
  },
  "aircrafts": [
    {
      "id": "IFR1",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 0,
      "earliestSeconds": 0,
      "latestSeconds": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "IFR2",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 240,
      "earliestSeconds": 240,
      "latestSeconds": 600
    },
    {
      "id": "IFR3",
      "flightRules": "IFR",
      "etaSeconds": 480,
      "earliestSeconds": 480,
      "latestSeconds": 840
    },
    {
      "id": "VFR",
      "flightRules": "VFR",
      "etaSeconds": 360,
      "earliestSeconds": 300,
      "latestSeconds": 420
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Evaluare pe ruta alternativă (/api/evaluate)
GET {{AERIS_API_HostAddress}}/api/evaluate
Accept: application/json

###
